{"4056160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orchard Outbreak: Slime Time", "steam_appid": 4056160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dine, dash, and defend the orchard.</strong><br>This is a fast-paced <strong>asymmetrical multiplayer</strong> game where <strong>one player controls two determined farmers</strong>, and <strong>everyone else plays as mischievous slimes</strong> trying to steal every apple on the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the farmers, your only way to stop the slime infestation is simple: <strong>tackle the slimes</strong> to knock the apples out of their gooey grips and reclaim the orchard. As a slime, you'll work together to shake trees and eat apples scattered around the map, but be careful apples make you full and slow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s chaotic, competitive, and endlessly replayable—perfect for party nights or quick rounds of pure slime-fueled nonsense.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dine, dash, and defend the orchard.</strong><br>This is a fast-paced <strong>asymmetrical multiplayer</strong> game where <strong>one player controls two determined farmers</strong>, and <strong>everyone else plays as mischievous slimes</strong> trying to steal every apple on the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the farmers, your only way to stop the slime infestation is simple: <strong>tackle the slimes</strong> to knock the apples out of their gooey grips and reclaim the orchard. As a slime, you'll work together to shake trees and eat apples scattered around the map, but be careful apples make you full and slow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s chaotic, competitive, and endlessly replayable—perfect for party nights or quick rounds of pure slime-fueled nonsense.</p>", "short_description": "Asymmetrical multiplayer game of cops and robbers where the cops are farmers and the robbers are slimes trying to eat the farmers app